<title>DUBAI: Oman's Sultan Qaboos ends UAE visit.</title>
<headline>Oman's Sultan Qaboos ends UAE visit.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Oman's Sultan Qaboos bin Said ended a two-day visit to the United Arab Emirates, the official UAE News Agency (WAM) said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The Sultan, who flew to Abu Dhabi from Doha on Monday after attending the closing session of the annual Gulf Cooperation Council summit, held talks with UAE's President Sheikh Zaid bin Sultan al-Nahayan, WAM added.</p>
<p>It said Sultan Qaboos returned to Muscat.</p>
</text>
